  300: /// Exposes the editor's [SharedTextLayoutCache] down the subtree so each
  301: /// [_TextSelectionSurface] can fetch (and reuse) its [TextLayoutService] across
  302: /// remount, without threading the cache through every renderer widget.
  303: class _SharedLayoutCacheScope extends InheritedWidget {
